  <h2>Boundaries enforced in code</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>The activity itself provides the reason to continue; the system does not add streaks, daily targets or withheld rewards.</li>
    <li>The scheduler responds to approved activities and their deadlines, rather than absence or time-spent metrics.</li>
    <li>
      The review gate makes the profile available only to the models that write and run an activity.
      User-facing displays, printed sheets and panel pages receive reviewed activity content.
    </li>
    <li>The vision path processes returned sheets. Its schema carries marks or blank, rather than faces, identity, emotion, attention or biometric data.</li>
  </ul>

